{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:25-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.SAVINGS.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["lt"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Nor\u0117dami i\u0161trinti, naudokite \u201eBackspace\u201c klavi\u0161\u0105."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Rodykli\u0173 klavi\u0161ai \u012f kair\u0119, \u012f vir\u0161\u0173 ir \u012f apa\u010di\u0105 yra i\u0161jungti. Taip pat i\u0161jungti \u201eHome\u201c, \u201eEnd\u201c, \u201ePgUp\u201c ir \u201ePgDn\u201c klavi\u0161ai."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Naudokite \u201eBackspace\u201c, kad i\u0161trintum\u0117te."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Jei pasirinkta reik\u0161m\u0117, tiesiog prad\u0117kite ra\u0161yti nauj\u0105 reik\u0161m\u0119, kad i\u0161trintum\u0117te ankstesn\u0119 reik\u0161m\u0119."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["Kai pasirinktas skai\u010dius (reik\u0161m\u0117 rodoma atvirk\u0161\u010diai), naudokite rodykl\u0117s \u012f de\u0161in\u0119 klavi\u0161\u0105, kad panaikintum\u0117te pasirinkim\u0105, bet nei\u0161valytum\u0117te reik\u0161m\u0117s. Tada backspace, kad gal\u0117tum\u0117te redaguoti."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["PATARIMAS: Paprastai norint pereiti nuo vieno \u012fvesties veiksmo prie kito ar ankstesnio, geriausia naudoti TAB arba SHIFT-TAB klavi\u0161us."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["2 PATARIMAS: Paprastai vert\u0117s redagavimas yra neveiksmingas. Kadangi reik\u0161m\u0117s pasirenkamos automati\u0161kai, tiesiog \u012fveskite norim\u0105 skai\u010di\u0173."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Ne\u012fveskite t\u016bkstan\u010dio skiriamojo \u017eenklo."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Naudojant JAV konvencij\u0105, tai b\u016bt\u0173 kablelis.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Esu pakankamai protingas, kad \u012fves\u010diau juos u\u017e jus!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["\u012evyko ne\u017einomos datos skai\u010diavimo klaida."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Pateikite mums savo \u012fvestis ir nustatymus, kad gal\u0117tume tai i\u0161taisyti. A\u010di\u016b."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Data negalioja - neteisingi metai."],"Jan":["Sau"],"Feb":["Vas"],"Mar":["Kov"],"Apr":["Bal"],"May":["gegu\u017e\u0117"],"Jun":["Bir"],"Jul":["Lie"],"Aug":["Rgp"],"Sept":["Rgs"],"Oct":["Spa"],"Nov":["Lap"],"Dec":["Gruod."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Klaida: datos ne i\u0161 eil\u0117s."],"Exception":["I\u0161imtis"],"occurred when accessing":["\u012fvyko, kai buvo kreiptasi \u012f"],"Invalid index":["Netinkamas indeksas"],"YTD":["Nuo met\u0173 prad\u017eios"],"Running Totals":["Kaupiamosios sumos"],"Your Personalized Savings Schedule":["J\u016bs\u0173 asmeninis taupymo grafikas"],"Cash Flow Summary":["Pinig\u0173 sraut\u0173 santrauka"],"Total Savings":["Bendra santaup\u0173 suma"],"Number of Investments":["Investicij\u0173 skai\u010dius"],"Return on Investment (ROI)":["Investicij\u0173 gr\u0105\u017ea (ROI)"],"Total Gain":["Bendras pelnas"],"Last Cash Flow Date":["Paskutinio pinig\u0173 srauto data"],"Years":["Metai"],"Savings Schedule":["Taupymo grafikas"],"Year":["Metai"],"Date":["Data"],"Deposit":["Ind\u0117lis"],"Interest":["Pal\u016bkanos"],"Net Change":["Grynasis pokytis"],"Balance":["Likutis"],"Annual Savings":["Metin\u0117s santaupos"],"Annual Interest":["Metin\u0117s pal\u016bkanos"],"Change in Balance":["Balanso pokytis"],"Annual Savings and Interest Totals":["Metini\u0173 santaup\u0173 ir pal\u016bkan\u0173 sumos"],"Accumulated Savings and Interest":["Sukauptos santaupos ir pal\u016bkanos"],"Amount Saved & Interest as Percentage of Total Value":["Sutaupyta suma ir pal\u016bkanos kaip bendros vert\u0117s procentas"],"Running Investment":["Kaupiamosios investicijos"],"Running Savings":["Kaupiamosios santaupos"],"Running Interest":["Kaupiamosios pal\u016bkanos"],"Total Deposits":["I\u0161 viso ind\u0117li\u0173"],"Total Interest Earned":["I\u0161 viso u\u017edirbt\u0173 pal\u016bkan\u0173"],"Total Value":["Bendra vert\u0117"],"Pct. of Total":["Proc. i\u0161 viso"],"Number of Deposits":["Ind\u0117li\u0173 skai\u010dius"],"Interest Rate":["Pal\u016bkan\u0173 norma"],"Total Interest":["Bendra pal\u016bkan\u0173 suma"],"\"Net Change\" is change from prior period i.e. prior balance plus deposit, plus interest less withdrawal.":["\"Grynasis pokytis\" - tai pokytis, palyginti su ankstesniu laikotarpiu, t. y. ankstesnis likutis plius ind\u0117lis, plius pal\u016bkanos, minus i\u0161\u0117mimas."],"Annual Deposit and Interest Totals":["Bendros metini\u0173 ind\u0117li\u0173 ir pal\u016bkan\u0173 sumos"],"Accumulated Deposit and Interest":["Sukaupti ind\u0117liai ir pal\u016bkanos"],"Annual Deposit":["Metinis ind\u0117lis"],"Running Deposit":["Kaupiamasis ind\u0117lis"],"Savings Calculator \u2014 calculate future value":["Santaup\u0173 skai\u010diuokl\u0117 - apskai\u010diuokite b\u016bsim\u0105 vert\u0119"],"<p>This calculator easily answers the question \"If I save \"X\" amount for \"Y\" months what will the value be at the end?\"<\/p>":["<p>\u0160i skai\u010diuokl\u0117 lengvai atsako \u012f klausim\u0105: \"Jei taupau \"X\" sum\u0105 \"Y\" m\u0117nesius, kokia bus vert\u0117 pabaigoje?\"<\/p>"],"<p>The user enters the \"Periodic Savings Amount\" (amount saved or invested every month); the \"Number of Months\" and the \"Annual Interest Rate\" or the annual rate of return one expects to earn on their investments.<\/p>":["<p>Vartotojas \u012fveda \"Periodin\u0119 Santaup\u0173 Sum\u0105\" (santaupas ar investicijas kiekvien\u0105 m\u0117nes\u012f); \"M\u0117nesi\u0173 Skai\u010di\u0173\" ir \"Metin\u0119 Pal\u016bkan\u0173 Norm\u0105\" arba tik\u0117tin\u0105 metin\u0119 gr\u0105\u017eos norm\u0105.<\/p>"],"<p>The calculator quickly creates a savings schedule and a set of charts that will help the user see the relationship between the amount invested and the return on the investment.<\/p>":["<p>Skai\u010diuokl\u0117 greitai sukuria santaup\u0173 grafik\u0105 ir diagram\u0173 rinkin\u012f, kuris padeda vartotojui pamatyti ry\u0161\u012f tarp investuotos sumos ir investicij\u0173 gr\u0105\u017eos.<\/p>"],"<p>The investment term is always expressed in months.<\/p>":["<p>Investavimo laikotarpis visada i\u0161rei\u0161kiamas m\u0117nesiais.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = &nbsp;5 metai<\/li><li>120 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 10 met\u0173<\/li><li>180 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 15 met\u0173<\/li><li>240 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 20 met\u0173<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 m\u0117nesi\u0173 = 30 met\u0173<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you would like to easily print the schedule; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Jei jums reikia labiau pa\u017eengusios \"santaup\u0173 skai\u010diuokl\u0117\" - tokios, kuri leid\u017eia vartotojui apskai\u010diuoti pradin\u0119 sum\u0105, investuojam\u0105 sum\u0105, pal\u016bkan\u0173 norm\u0105, laikotarp\u012f, reikaling\u0105 tikslui pasiekti, arba b\u016bsim\u0105j\u0105 vert\u0119; arba jei norite lengvai atspausdinti grafik\u0105; arba jei reikia pasirinkti kit\u0105 investavimo da\u017en\u012f, galite i\u0161bandyti skai\u010diuokl\u0119 \u010dia: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">If you need a more advanced \"Savings Calculator\" - one that lets the user solve for the starting amount, the amount to invest, the interest rate, the term required to reach a goal or the future value; or if you need to pick a different investment frequency, then you may want to try the calculator located here: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Jei jums reikia labiau pa\u017eengusios \"santaup\u0173 skai\u010diuokl\u0117\" - tokios, kuri leid\u017eia vartotojui apskai\u010diuoti pradin\u0119 sum\u0105, investuojam\u0105 sum\u0105, pal\u016bkan\u0173 norm\u0105, laikotarp\u012f, reikaling\u0105 tikslui pasiekti, arba b\u016bsim\u0105j\u0105 vert\u0119; arba jei reikia pasirinkti kit\u0105 investavimo da\u017en\u012f, galite i\u0161bandyti skai\u010diuokl\u0119 \u010dia: <b>https:\/\/AccurateCalculators.com\/savings-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Vardas"],"Address":["Adresas"],"City, State  ZIP":["Miestas, valstija, pa\u0161to kodas"],"Prepared On":["Parengimo data"],"Prepared by":["Pareng\u0117"],"Phone":["Telefonas"],"Email":["El. pa\u0161tas"],"Website":["Svetain\u0117"],"Unknown":["Ne\u017einomas"],"u":["n"],"U":["N"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datos turi b\u016bti pirm\u0105j\u0105 m\u0117nesio dien\u0105."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Neteisingas JavaScript datos objektas."],"Monthly":["m\u0117nesinis"]}}}